{"sourceUrl":"https://niohp.chinacdc.cn/sndt/202506/t20250603_307241.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:26.931702+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://niohp.chinacdc.cn/sndt/202506/t20250603_307241.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span> </span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><font>中国疾病预防控制中心职业卫生与中毒控制所（简称职业卫生所）始建于</font><font>1954年，前身是中央卫生研究院（1956年改称中国医学科学院）劳动卫生研究所，是我国第一个</font></span></span></span><span><span><span><font>由国家政府主办的</font></span></span></span><span><span><span><font>劳动卫生与职业病研究和防治的专业学术机构。</font></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>职业卫生所是中国疾病预防控制中心</font></span></span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>中国预防医学科学院）</font></span></span><span><span><font>的直属事业单位，是</font><font>“全国劳动卫生职业病防治中心”、</font></span></span><span><span><font>“</font><font><font>化学品毒性鉴定质量考核合格机构</font></font><font>”、</font></span></span><span><span><font>国家化学中毒救治基地；</font></span></span><span><span><font>是</font></span></span><span><span><font>劳动卫生与环境卫生学、卫生毒理学博士硕士学位授权点</font></span></span><span><span><font>、公共卫生博士硕士专业学位授权点</font></span></span><span><span><font>和博士后流动站</font></span></span><span><span><font>。</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span>一、活动目的</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>为增进优秀大学生对职业卫生</font></span></span><span><span><font>工作</font></span></span><span><span><font>的认识，</font></span></span><span><span><font>为</font></span></span><span><span><font>全国</font></span></span><span><span><font>重点院校</font></span></span><span><span><font>优秀应届毕业生提供了解职业卫生所学术科研</font></span></span><span><span><font>活动与</font></span></span><span><span><font>学习生活环境的机会，搭建导师和学生之间交流的平台</font></span></span><span><span><font>，</font></span></span><span><span><font>职业卫生所</font></span></span><span><span><font>拟</font></span></span><span><span><font>举办</font><font>202</font></span></span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span><span><span><font>年全国优秀大学生</font><font>“相约疾控•‘职’等你来”暑期夏令营活动</font></span></span><span><span><font>。</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>二</font></span></span><span><span><font>、时间安排</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>报名时间：即日起至</font><font>202</font></span></span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span><span><span><font>年</font></span></span><span><span><font>6</font></span></span><span><span><font>月</font></span></span><span><span><font>27</font></span></span><span><span><font>日</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>活动时间：</font></span></span><span><span><font>2025年7月上旬或中旬</font></span></span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>具体举办时间</font></span></span><span><span><font>另行通知）</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>三</font></span></span><span><span><font>、招收人数和活动方式</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>夏令营</font></span></span><span><span><font>拟面向全国高校</font></span></span><span><span><font>择优</font></span></span><span><span><font>招收</font></span></span><span><span><font>约</font><font>20名</font></span></span><span><span><font>营员，活动</font></span></span><span><span><font>采用</font></span></span><span><span><font>参观、专家讲座、师生交流</font></span></span><span><span><font>和</font></span></span><span><span><font>招生咨询等多种</font></span></span><span><span><font>形式开展</font></span></span><span><span><font>（具体活动安排及日程以入选后正式通知为准）。</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>四</font></span></span><span><span><font>、招收对象与报名条件</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>一）</font></span></span><span><span><font>品德良好</font></span></span><span><span><font>、</font></span></span><span><span><font>遵纪守法</font></span></span><span><span><font>、</font></span></span><span><span><font>身心健康</font></span></span><span><span><font>、</font></span></span><span><span><font>学风端正</font></span></span><span><span><font>。</font></span></span><span><span><font>202</font></span></span><span><span><font>6</font></span></span><span><span><font>年毕业的普通高校全日制在校本科生，预计有推免资格者优先</font></span></span><span><span><font>；</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>二）</font></span></span><span><span><font>对职业病预防控制有浓厚兴趣，有志</font></span></span><span><span><font>从事</font></span></span><span><span><font>相关学术或应用研究工作，具有较强或潜在的科研和创新能力</font></span></span><span><span><font>，</font></span></span><span><span><font>具有公共卫生、预防医学等医学相关专业背景或相关交叉学科背景</font></span></span><span><span><font>优先；</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>三）</font></span></span><span><span><font>学习成绩优秀，</font></span></span><span><span><font>“双一流”</font></span></span><span><span><font>高校学生截至目前总评成绩在本专业排名前</font><font>50%、“所在学科教育部第四轮学科评估B+及以上”高校学生截至目前总评成绩在本专业排名前20%、普通类高校学生截至目前总评成绩在本专业排名前5%优先</font></span></span><span><span><font>；</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>四）</font></span></span><span><span><font>英语水平良好，最低需要达到全国大学英语六级</font></span></span><span><span><font>（</font><font>430分以上）或TOEFL、GRE等考试成绩优秀者。</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>五</font></span></span><span><span><font>、申请材料</font> </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>一）</font></span></span><span><span><font>《职业卫生所</font><font>202</font></span></span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span><span><span><font>年大学生暑期夏令营报名申请表》（点击附件</font><font>1下载，加盖公章提交扫描件）； </font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>二）</font></span></span><span><span><font>本人有效期内的身份证与学生证</font></span></span><span><span><font>原件</font></span></span><span><span><font>扫描件；</font> </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>三）</font></span></span><span><span><font>加盖院系教务部门公章</font></span></span><span><span><font>的</font></span></span><span><span><font>本科成绩单扫描件；</font> </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>四）</font></span></span><span><span><font>外语水平证明</font></span></span><span><span><font>原件</font></span></span><span><span><font>扫描件，如</font><font>CET-6、雅思、托福、专业外语成绩等； </font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>五）</font></span></span><span><span><font>其他可证明培养潜力和能力的材料</font></span></span><span><span><font>扫描件</font></span></span><span><span><font>：如在学术期刊上发表的文章、出版物或其他学术作品</font></span></span><span><span><font>、</font></span></span><span><span><font>专利</font></span></span><span><span><font>、</font></span></span><span><span><font>各类获奖证书等。</font> </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>六</font></span></span><span><span><font>、报名及入选事宜</font> </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>一）</font></span></span><span><span><font>以上所有材料</font></span></span><span><span><font>的扫描件</font></span></span><span><span><font>，按照</font></span></span><span><span><font>上述</font></span></span><span><span><font>顺序生成一份</font><font>pdf格式文件，于202</font></span></span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span><span><span><font>年</font></span></span><span><span><font>6</font></span></span><span><span><font>月</font></span></span><span><span><font>27</font></span></span><span><span><font>日前发送</font><font>guyt@niohp.chinacdc.cn，逾期不再接收。邮件主题为: XX大学-XX专业-XX（姓名）</font></span></span><span><span><font>；</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>二）</font></span></span><span><span><font>邮件发出后请点击：</font><font><font>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/moO3qlq.aspx</font></font><font>进行报名信息登记</font></span></span><span><span><font>；</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>三）</font></span></span><span><span><font>职业卫生所将以申请者的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质等作为主要评价依据，</font></span></span><span><span><font>从</font></span></span><span><span><font>申请者</font></span></span><span><span><font>中</font></span></span><span><span><font>筛选出</font></span></span><span><span><font>约</font></span></span><span><span><font>20</font></span></span><span><span><font>人，</font></span></span><span><span><font>并于</font></span></span><span><span><font>活动</font></span></span><span><span><font>举办前通过电话和邮件告知入选者。未接到通知的同学即未入选，</font></span></span><span><span><font>职业卫生所</font></span></span><span><span><font>不再另行通知。</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>七</font></span></span><span><span><font>、营员待遇</font> </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>一）</font></span></span><span><span><font>本次夏令营将根据营员表现评选出优秀营员，颁发优秀营员证书。</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>二）</font></span></span><span><span><font>夏令营期间提供免费食宿，交通费用自理。正式录取为职业卫生所研究生后（推免生以通过推免系统完成拟录取为准，统考生以一志愿复试录取为准）凭票据报销往返路费（高铁或动车二等座、普通列车硬座或硬卧、飞机经济舱）</font></span></span><span><span><font>；</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>三）</font></span></span><span><span><font>职业卫生所为营员统一购买活动期间的团体意外保险。</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>八</font></span></span><span><span><font>、其他注意事项</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>一）</font></span></span><span><span><font>申请人应保证填报信息、提交材料的真实性和准确性。凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实即取消申请资格</font></span></span><span><span><font>；</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>二）</font></span></span><span><span><font>活动最新消息可在职业卫生所官网的通知公告栏目查询（网址：</font></span></span><span><span>https://www.niohp.net.cn/</span></span><span><span> <font>）</font></span></span><span><span><font>；</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>（</font></span></span><span><span><font>三）</font></span></span><span><span><font>入选</font></span></span><span><span><font>营员</font></span></span><span><span><font>报到时需提供本人学生证及身份证原件，服从职业卫生所安排，全程参加夏令营活动。</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>九</font></span></span><span><span><font>、联系方式</font> </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>联</font> <font>系</font> <font>人：顾老师</font>  <font>秦老师</font> </span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>联系电话：</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>010-83132901，010-83132193； </font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>电子邮箱：</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><a href=\"mailto:guyt@niohp.chinacdc.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span><span><span><span><span><font>guyt@niohp.chinacdc.cn</font></span></span></span></span></span></u></a></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>附件：</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>1.</font></span></span><span><span><font>职业卫生所</font></span></span><span><span><font>202</font></span></span><span><span><font>5</font></span></span><span><span><font>年大学生暑期夏令营报名申请表</font></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><font>2</font></span></span><span><span><font>.职业卫生所简</font></span></span><span><span><font>介</font></span></span></span></p>\n </div>","textSha256":"738e56013128986409d574422a9b393eebb6391fb3dc5d4a032c7ec847cfba31","textLength":1699,"sourceSha256":"09c5927187271ceb6d3f9651da1d6fcd656922d5745584be54a9a22aa94cc0c6","selector":".TRS_Editor","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1681261dd397031b1604","title":"2025年中国疾病预防控制中心职业卫生与中毒控制所2025年大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:26.931702+00:00"}
